<title>DENMARK: Tele Danmark to issue 96 report, March 18.</title>
<headline>Tele Danmark to issue 96 report, March 18.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish telecoms group Tele Danmark said on Wednesday that it would publish its 1996 annual report on the afternoon of March 18.</p>
<p>Profits are expected to show the effects of a costly price war with rival mobile phone operator Sonofon.</p>
<p>Tele Danmark in August cited those costs as a main factor in the 20 percent fall in its first-half profits to 2.178 billion crowns and said that the full year result was likely to be less than 1995's 3.494 billion.</p>
<p>--Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969650</p>
</text>
